            "action_name": {
              "value": "Shell Game"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The graveshell withdraws into its shell, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and allowing it to use Shell Block. This lasts until the graveshell moves or attacks with any attack other than its shell spikes. The graveshell can't take this action or get any benefit from it if its shell is broken."
            },
